e the Garou speaks (not howls) a 2 minute prayer, begging forgivenss for such harm as his vehicle has caused. begining in the Car journeying around to the tail pipe where he lifts his voice in melancholy haunting, often times wordless song.<br /> <br /> (OOC: Also helps create An air of &quot;This guy is weird&quot; Which is all too often a homid garous fate, without descending into &quot;this Bozo needs locked up!!!&quot;) <br /> <br /> Im not sure what all should be involved, or what mechanical benefit should come with it... thinking a theme of &quot;Some inconvenience we run into everyday in cars, is really cause by angry gaian spirits, and wont strike you as much because they see how much you respect them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-08T17:28:58-07:00","id":928524,"title":"","content":"Man that's a good idea, better come up with one for when you also flick on 